## 🗄️ Database Schema (9 Tables)

| Table | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `Parent` | Parent details & wallet balance |
| `Student` | Student details linked to Parent |
| `Transactions` | All wallet transactions |
| `Menu` | Canteen items & prices |
| `Coupons` | Order receipts |
| `Coupon_Items` | Individual items per coupon |
| `Users` | Cashier & Admin accounts |
| `Class_Master` | Class list |
| `Division_Master` | Division list |

## 🔌 API Endpoints (19 Total)

### Auth Routes
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/parent/login` | Send OTP to parent |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/parent/verify-otp` | Verify OTP & get JWT |
| POST | `/api/v1/auth/user/login` | Cashier/Admin login |

### Parent Routes
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/v1/parent/dashboard` | Balance & recent transactions |
| GET | `/api/v1/parent/transactions` | Full transaction history |
| POST | `/api/v1/parent/topup` | Mock wallet top-up |

### Cashier Routes
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/v1/students/search?q=` | Search by barcode/name |
| GET | `/api/v1/students/:id/balance` | Get student & parent balance |
| GET | `/api/v1/menu` | Get all menu items |
| POST | `/api/v1/coupons` | Create order coupon |
| GET | `/api/v1/coupons/day-summary` | Shift summary |

### Admin Routes
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/v1/admin/dashboard` | Overview stats |
| GET | `/api/v1/admin/deposits` | All parent balances |
| POST | `/api/v1/admin/manual-topup` | Manual cash top-up |
| GET | `/api/v1/admin/sales` | Sales report |
| POST | `/api/v1/admin/import` | CSV data import |
| GET/POST | `/api/v1/admin/users` | User management |
| CRUD | `/api/v1/menu` | Menu management |

